  "discrepancies": [],
  "gaps": [
    "MeowDB has no numeric shop id; \"id\" is the shop slug MeowDB uses as the /npc-shops anchor.",
    "Purchase quantity: MeowDB prices one unit (quantity_per_purchase = 1) but documents no limit on how many units one purchase may buy.",
    "stock_limit: MeowDB documents no stock limits (finite or restocking) for NPC shops.",
    "Selling 0-mesos items: MeowDB records sell-back 0 for 3 item(s) here but does not say whether the NPC refuses them or pays 0 mesos.",
    "Recharge: no item in this shop has a \"Recharge Cost\" row, and MeowDB does not say whether this NPC recharges throwing stars.",
    "Sell rules: MeowDB documents per-item sell-back values only; it gives no general sell-price formula and no shop-specific sell restrictions."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "MeowDB price note for this shop: \"Community screenshots 2026-08-12 (COT2) posted in Discord by SiuoL93; each list read top-to-bottom and found IDENTICAL to the first test - re-dated, not repriced.\"",
    "price_mesos is the base price of ONE unit, in mesos. The citizenship discount (formulas/leveling, citizenship) applies only in Henesys or Kerning City, so it never applies to this shop; citizen_req is null on every row.",
    "sell_price_mesos is 0 for 541 Sword; 576 Hand Axe; 585 Wooden Club: the item API records stats.price 0 and the item page omits its \"NPC Sell-back\" row when the value is 0. Where the page does show the row, it equals the API value (7/7 rows across the Maple Island shops, and reference item 294 matching). Items MeowDB has no value for (the Safe-to-Sell \"droppedNoPrice\" items: 519 Glowing Mushroom, 2697 Luminous Magical Resonance, 2692 Rotten Root Fragment) have no price key at all, so 0 is a recorded value, not a gap.",
    "Equipment item pages note: \"NPC shop copies always roll clean.\" Equipment bought here has the item's clean (base) stats.",
    "icon_key is MeowDB's icon key for the item. It is not the MeowDB item id; use item_id to join with items data."
  ]
